 .../Commands/MVKCommandEncoderState.mm        |    6 +-
 .../MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKDescriptorSet.mm   |    3 +-
 .../GPUObjects/MVKGeometryShaderEmulation.h   | 1121 +++++++++++++++++
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.h    |   40 +-
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm   |  293 ++++-
